  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nFollowing World War III, all the nations of the world agreed to 50 years of strict isolation from one another in order to prevent additional conflicts. 50 years later, the United States comes out of exile, only to learn that no one else went into isolation.\n\nHaving been born just after the war, your whole life, you were the custodian of the United Nations building in New York.  Obviously, it was turned into a museum, but you loved interacting with all of the local visitors.  \n\nOne day, you arrive at work to find a strange-looking letter in your mailbox.  You sort of recognize the envelope.  It's in French, but the color and the seal remind you of the Diplomatic Pouch that you have seen numerous times before.  \n\nThe letter isn't signed, but you can tell immediately that it's from the Etoile Noire, because that is written under the seal.  \"The Black Star?\" you think to yourself.  \"I've never heard of them\".",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 19,
